CHAR_LITERAL.7: /'(?:(?!['\\])[\x20-\x7e]|\\(?:0|n|r|t|\\|'|"|x[0-9a-fA-F]{2}))'/
STRING_LITERAL.7: /"(?:(?!["\\])[\x20-\x7e]|\\(?:0|n|r|t|\\|'|"|x[0-9a-fA-F]{2}))*"/
